{"id":"n72859-1-13","stage":5,"title":"인내심 · 耐心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72859-1-13-1","ko":"배고파서 더 이상은 못 하겠어.","zh":"我太饿了，实在坚持不下去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배고파서","meaning":"肚子饿","explanation":"배고프다：肚子饿；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"배고프다","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29316","senseId":"1","lemma":"배고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이상은","meaning":"到此结束，结束","explanation":"이상：到此结束，结束；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"4","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하겠어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8186b5026911737a","term":"배고프다","zh":"肚子饿","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3","entryId":"29316","definition":"感到肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["배고프다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"到此结束，结束","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"文件或演讲等在最后使用，表示“结束”的意思。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b0144b912e9f1b7d3549.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72859-1-13-2","ko":"나도 인내심이 한계에 달했어. 일단 우리 밥부터 먹고 하자.","zh":"我的耐心也到极限了。我们先吃饭吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인내심이","meaning":"耐心","explanation":"인내심：耐心；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인내심","audio":"/audio/6eb0f98afba1da059baf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72859","senseId":"1","lemma":"인내심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한계에","meaning":"界限，边界，局限，极限","explanation":"한계：界限，边界，局限，极限；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한계","audio":"/audio/e2073416fa2604c83c23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84093","senseId":"1","lemma":"한계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달했어.","meaning":"达到","explanation":"달하다：达到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"달하다","audio":"/audio/f099a666ebb0cb40a258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44163","senseId":"1","lemma":"달하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일단","meaning":"暂时","explanation":"일단：暂时","readings":[{"term":"일단","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25132","senseId":"2","lemma":"일단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥부터","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하자.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"6eb0f98afba1da05","term":"인내심","zh":"耐心","audio":"/audio/6eb0f98afba1da059baf.mp3","entryId":"72859","definition":"忍受痛苦或困难的决心。","pronunciation":["인내심"]},{"id":"e2073416fa2604c8","term":"한계","zh":"界限，边界，局限，极限","audio":"/audio/e2073416fa2604c83c23.mp3","entryId":"84093","definition":"某事实际发生或造成影响的范围或界线。","pronunciation":["한ː계","한ː게"]},{"id":"f099a666ebb0cb40","term":"달하다","zh":"达到","audio":"/audio/f099a666ebb0cb40a258.mp3","entryId":"44163","definition":"到达某种程度、水准、数量和状态等。","pronunciation":["달하다"]},{"id":"47a337529350ca3e","term":"일단","zh":"暂时","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3","entryId":"25132","definition":"先在短时间内。","pronunciation":["일딴"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc20bb551a7b76bac91f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.474,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72859","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.3007,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我太饿了，实在坚持不下去了。","我的耐心也到极限了。我们先吃饭吧。","我们家孩子又打架了？到底是什么问题啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我太饿了，实在坚持不下去了。","我的耐心也到极限了。我们先吃饭吧。","我们家孩子又打架了？到底是什么问题啊？"],"answer":1}]}
